# Formatting policy for the whole tree (TODO.md item C6): LLVM base style,
# 4-space indentation, 100-column limit. The CI gate that enforces it is
# .github/workflows/clang-format.yml (TODO.md item C11); the local mirror is item C7.
# PointerAlignment stays LLVM's (Right): the base is fixed by C6, and the
# `const std::string& n` example in CONTRACT.md is an illustration, not a MUST rule.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
